@comment{
  RECOVERED: sources whose metadata has been confirmed from an authoritative
  web source (publisher, DOI/Crossref, ACL Anthology, AAAI OJS, arXiv, CEUR,
  or the authors' own pages). Having a PDF is not required; a missing PDF is
  tracked in the note as status: to-obtain. Cite only from this file.

  Unconfirmed sources live in solo_ttrpg_believed.bib. Move an entry here
  once its metadata is confirmed.

  Conventions
  - Citekey: firstauthorYEARfirstword, lowercase, no punctuation
    (first significant word of the title; skip "a", "an", "the").
  - keywords: field tags from survey/search_notes.md, the same tags as the
    `fields:` list in each note's frontmatter (survey/notes/<citekey>.md).
    `background` marks sources kept for context that are not survey seeds.
  - note: anything a citer needs to know (edition, version of the PDF held,
    unconfirmed details).

  Seed entries below verified 2026-10-17.
}

